      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a tremendous weight, feeling like you are living someone else's script. That feeling of being a ghost, disconnected from your own life, is exhausting and deeply painful. Please know that feeling this way is a signal that a part of you is desperately yearning for authentic selfhood. If you're feeling overwhelmed by this pressure, reaching out to a therapist or counselor can provide a safe space to explore these feelings and begin finding your own voice.",
