      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel that any form of \"coping\" is just a way to keep the current, suffocating structure intact. When everything feels like a performance, the idea of permanent escape can feel like the only honest choice left. If you are actively thinking about ending your life, please reach out to emergency services or a crisis line immediately; they are equipped to help you navigate these overwhelming feelings right now. You do not have to face this crushing weight alone.",
      "source": "target",
